nt_zip_version":"legacy","meta":{"source_pdf":"資料庫使用手冊Welfare8-87年婦女生活狀況調查.pdf","code_short":"W_MOHW_WLCS","name_zh":"婦女生活狀況調查","name_en":"Women live conditions survey","record_count_raw":"3,620","field_count_declared":89,"file_size_raw":"369KB","frequency":"年","attribute":"調查檔","update_history_raw":"2025/06/24","update_history":[{"date":"2025/06/24","note":""}],"data_description_zh":"1. 居住臺閩地區年滿15至64歲之我國女性人口(含調查期間在臺而尚未取得本國國\n籍之外籍配偶及大陸、港澳配偶)為調查母體，並採分層比例隨機抽樣法，在考慮\n抽樣誤差不超過1.5％及信賴水準至少95％。\n2. 調查項目包含：我國婦女之婚育狀況、個人狀況、工作狀況、經濟狀況、家庭狀\n況、社會參與及休閒活動狀況、資訊技能及終身學習狀況、人身威脅經驗、對婦\n女福利措施的瞭解與使用及期望政府或民間團體應加強提供的服務措施等。\n(引述行政院主計總處)","notes_zh":"1. 本中心資料庫業經去識別化處理，刪除姓名、地址等可直接識別欄位，如有身分\n證字號、院所代碼、投保單位代號、統一編號、出生日期、就醫日期、入院日期\n等欄位均經屏蔽處理，且相關資料僅能於本部設置之獨立作業區內使用，並攜出\n經審核通過之統計結果，以確保資料應用及其揭露方式已無從識別特定當事人。\n2. 調查檔共包含五個年度：1998、2002、2006、2011及2019年，因年度不同，資料\n欄位不盡相同。","primary_keys_raw":"無","qa":{"errors":[],"warnings":[]},"page_count":14,"code":"Welfare08","category":"Welfare","version_id":"legacy__wave_ROC87_AD1998","version_label":"legacy · 民國 87 年 (1998)","pdf_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-15829-eb96a71c-0743-4b84-8714-5c5c3c0edc60.html","pdf_sha256":"80006aa27cafeec03a74295b67a2d56c558823d055f7c3ea98b977b47befea56","doc_first_published":"2016-10-24","doc_last_updated":"2025-11-18","name_zh_from_listing":"資料庫使用手冊Welfare8-87年婦女生活狀況調查","data_description_en":"1. The survey population consisted of Taiwanese women aged 15 to 64 residing in the Taiwan-Fukien Area (including foreign spouses, and spouses from Mainland China, Hong Kong, or Macau, who were in Taiwan during the survey period but had not yet obtained ROC nationality), using stratified proportional random sampling, with a sampling error not exceeding 1.5% and a confidence level of at least 95%.\n2. Survey items include: the marital and childbearing status, personal status, employment status, economic status, family status, social participation and leisure activities, information skills and lifelong learning status, experience of personal threats, understanding and use of women's welfare measures, and expectations for services that the government or private organizations should strengthen, among Taiwanese women.\n(Quoted from the Directorate-General of Budget, Accounting and Statistics, Executive Yuan)","notes_en":"1. This Center's database has been de-identified: directly identifying fields such as name and address are deleted, and fields such as\nnational ID number, facility code, insured unit code, unified business number, date of birth, visit date and admission date\nare all masked. The data may be used only within the independent work area set up by the Ministry, and only\nstatistical results that have passed review may be taken out, to ensure that data use and disclosure cannot identify any specific individual.\n2. The survey file covers five years: 1998, 2002, 2006, 2011 and 2019; data\nfields differ by year.","primary_keys_en":"none","name_zh_en":"women's living condition survey","printed":{"field_rows":89,"code_tables":{},"code_table_headings":[]}},"fields_file":"Welfare08__legacy__wave_ROC87_AD1998.json","field_count":89,"supplementary":false,"garbled":false},{"code":"Welfare08","category":"Welfare","name_zh":"資料庫使用手冊Welfare8-91年婦女生活狀況調查","version_id":"legacy__wave_ROC91_AD2002","version_label":"legacy · 民國 91 年 (2002)","detail_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-15829-eb96a71c-0743-4b84-8714-5c5c3c0edc60.html","pdf_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-15829-eb96a71c-0743-4b84-8714-5c5c3c0edc60.html","file_type":"pdf","doc_first_published":"2016-10-24","doc_last_updated":"2025-11-18","sha256":"0aaa6be66d874e0bc73dea93836c3fbd4f590fb1d805396440ad525dedec2baa","local_filename":"raw_pdfs_zip/Welfare08_legacy/資料庫使用手冊Welfare8_婦女生活狀況調查/91/資料庫使用手冊Welfare8-91年婦女生活狀況調查.pdf","fetched_at":"from-zip","listing_page":6,"note":"unpacked from Welfare08_legacy.zip","parent_zip_version":"legacy","meta":{"source_pdf":"資料庫使用手冊Welfare8-91年婦女生活狀況調查.pdf","code_short":"W_MOHW_WLCS","name_zh":"婦女生活狀況調查","name_en":"Women live cond