述行政院主計總處)","notes_zh":"1. 本中心資料庫業經去識別化處理，刪除姓名、地址等可直接識別欄位，如有\n身分證字號、院所代碼、投保單位代號、統一編號、出生日期、就醫日期、\n入院日期等欄位均經屏蔽處理，且相關資料僅能於本部設置之獨立作業區內\n使用，並攜出經審核通過之統計結果，以確保資料應用及其揭露方式已無從\n識別特定當事人。\n2. 調查檔共包含五個年度：1998、2002、2006、2011、2015，因年度不同，資\n料欄位不盡相同。","primary_keys_raw":"無","qa":{"errors":[],"warnings":[]},"page_count":34,"code":"Welfare08","category":"Welfare","version_id":"legacy__wave_ROC104_AD2015","version_label":"legacy · 民國 104 年 (2015)","pdf_url":"https://www.mohw.gov.tw/dl-15829-eb96a71c-0743-4b84-8714-5c5c3c0edc60.html","pdf_sha256":"7a51f48416c508f2bf934afa1d02311432da7a8ee13c01b3481f941ce6a0cc40","doc_first_published":"2016-10-24","doc_last_updated":"2025-11-18","name_zh_from_listing":"資料庫使用手冊Welfare8-104年婦女生活狀況調查","data_description_en":"1. This survey used Taiwanese women aged 15 to 64 as the survey population, using stratified proportional random sampling, with a sampling error not exceeding 0.97% and a confidence level of at least 99%.\n2. Survey items include: employment, economic status and welfare, marriage/childbearing and family, health management, social participation, education and leisure, personal safety, life satisfaction, and expectations for services that the government should strengthen, among Taiwanese women.\n3. Some survey response audio data of poor quality were not provided.\n(Quoted from the Directorate-General of Budget, Accounting and Statistics, Executive Yuan)","notes_en":"1. This center's database has been de-identified: directly identifying fields such as name and address have been removed, and fields such as ID number, facility code, insured unit code, tax ID number, date of birth, visit date, and admission date have been masked. The data may only be used within the independent workspace established by the Ministry, and only approved aggregate statistical results may be taken out, ensuring that the data and its disclosure method can no longer identify specific individuals.\n2. The survey file covers five survey years in total: 1998, 2002, 2006