ive data, or is not applicable/cannot be answered.","notes_en":"1. Survey years covered include 1998, 2002, 2006, 2011, 2019, and 2024, but formats differ across years, so figures are not directly comparable across periods. This center's databases have each undergone separate de-identification processing, removing names, addresses, and other directly identifying fields such as ID numbers, institution codes, insurer unit codes, unified business numbers, dates of birth, visit dates, and admission dates. Data may only be used within the independent work area set up by this center, and only statistical results that have passed review may be taken out, to ensure that the use and disclosure of the data cannot identify any specific individual.","primary_keys_en":"","name_zh_en":"","_ocr_recovered":true},"fields_file":"Welfare08__legacy__wave_ROC113_AD2024.json","field_count":243,"supplementary":false,"garbled":true}]}